alse,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[17,15,70,65,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[17,15,70,65,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[17,15,70,65,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[17,15,70,65,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[17,15,70,65,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10957","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[17,15,70,65,71,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014905","helmet":"WP1025605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"诸葛亮之父，诸葛玄之兄，出身琅琊望族，先祖为西汉司隶校尉诸葛丰。东汉灵帝时，步入仕途，初为泰山郡梁父尉，以孝廉之名被应劭赏识，隔郡征辟到泰山郡任泰山郡丞（郡太守副职）。一生共育有三男两女。长子诸葛瑾，东吴重臣；次子诸葛亮，蜀汉名相；幼子诸葛均，后亦在蜀汉出仕。诸葛珪去世后，弟诸葛玄承担起抚养其子女的责任。","tc":"諸葛亮之父，諸葛玄之兄，出身瑯琊望族，先祖為西漢司隸校尉諸葛豐。東漢靈帝時，步入仕途，初為泰山郡梁父尉，以孝廉之名被應劭賞識，隔郡征辟到泰山郡任泰山郡丞（郡太守副職）。一生共育有三男兩女。長子諸葛瑾，東吳重臣；次子諸葛亮，蜀漢名相；幼子諸葛均，后亦在蜀漢出仕。諸葛珪去世后，弟諸葛玄承擔起撫養其子女的責任。","en":"Father of Zhuge Liang and elder brother of Zhuge Xuan, hailing from a prominent clan in Langya. His ancestor was Zhuge Feng, Colonel Director of Retainers during the Western Han dynasty. During the reign of Emperor Ling of the Eastern Han dynasty, he entered official service, first as the Commandant of Liangfu in Mount Tai Commandery. Recognized as Filial and Incorrupt, he was appreciated by Ying Shao and recruited to serve as Assistant to the Governor of Mount Tai Commandery. He fathered three sons and two daughters in his lifetime. His eldest son, Zhuge Jin, became a prominent minister of Eastern Wu, his second son, Zhuge Liang, was the famed Chancellor of Shu Han, and his youngest son, Zhuge Jun, later also served in Shu Han. Following Zhuge Gui's death, his younger brother Zhuge Xuan took up the duty of raising his children.","jp":"諸葛亮の父であり、諸葛玄の兄。琅邪の名門出身で、先祖は西漢の司隷校尉・諸葛豊。東漢の霊帝の時代に出仕し、初めは泰山郡梁父尉を務め、孝廉として応劭に見出され、他郡より招聘されて泰山郡丞（郡太守の副職）に任じられた。生涯で三男二女をもうけた。長男の諸葛瑾は東呉の重臣、次男の諸葛亮は蜀漢の名相となり、三男の諸葛均も後に蜀漢に出仕した。諸葛珪の没後は、弟の諸葛玄がその遺児たちを引き取って養育した。","kr":"제갈량의 아버지이자 제갈현의 형이다. 낭야의 명문가 출신으로, 선조는 서한의 사례교위 제갈풍이다. 동한 영제 때 벼슬길에 올라 처음에는 태산군 양보위를 지냈으며, 효렴으로 응소의 인정을 받아 다른 군에서 태산군승(군 태수의 부직)으로 징벽되었다. 슬하에 3남 2녀를 두었는데, 장남 제갈근은 동오의 중신, 차남 제갈량은 촉한의 명상이 되었으며 막내 제갈균 역시 훗날 촉한에서 벼슬을 지냈다. 제갈규가 세상을 떠난 뒤에는 아우 제갈현이 자녀들을 부양하는 책임을 맡았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1028315","remark":"","surname":"诸葛","surnameTc":"諸葛","surnameEn":"Zhuge","surnameJp":"諸葛","surnameKr":"제갈","surnameOther":"","name":"珪","nameTc":"珪","nameEn":"Gui","nameJp":"珪","nameKr":"규","nameOther":"","word":"君贡","wordTc"